---
description: Flight scrape pipeline — on-demand only
globs:
  - scripts/run_flights.py
  - scripts/pipeline/**
  - sheet_live.csv
---

Do not start `pipeline_lotes.py`, tmux scrape sessions, or background MCP apply unless the user explicitly asks (e.g. P-refresh, P-all, P2).

Default: user runs `run_flights.cmd --refresh-sheet` or asks for step P1–P5.

Full sheet refresh: `--refresh-sheet` (all CSV rows, fresh links via route_links.py, writes A:L including Actualizado; includes step 5 purge).

Partial ranges and `pipeline_lotes.py`: always use `--no-purge` on `--all` (step 5 scans the whole CSV, not the batch). Run `--step 5` only when the user wants a global purge.
